  "text": "Car & RV Cleaning is essential for keeping your vehicle's interior fresh, healthy, and looking its best. Whether you own a car, RV, boat, or yacht, the interior surfaces take a beating over time. Dirt, spills, pet dander, and odors build up inside your vehicle's carpet and upholstery — and that's exactly where Carpet & Duct Cleaning comes in. We specialize in professional interior carpet and upholstery cleaning for cars, RVs, boats, and yachts across Orange County, CA. We do not wash exteriors or detail vehicle paint. Our service is focused exclusively on what you sit on and walk on inside — carpeted floors, fabric seats, headliners, and upholstered surfaces. If the inside of your vehicle smells stale, looks stained, or just needs a deep refresh, our professional car & RV cleaning team can help. Why Professional Car & RV Cleaning Matters Most people focus on the outside of their vehicle — a quick wash and wax — but the inside is where you spend all your time. According to EPA indoor air quality research , indoor pollutants can build up in confined spaces, including vehicle interiors. Professional car & RV cleaning makes a real difference: Eliminate Odors at the Source: DIY sprays and air fresheners only mask smells. Our truck-mounted hot-water extraction system removes the dirt and bacteria causing the odor from deep within the carpet fibers and upholstery foam. Remove Deep Stains: Coffee, food, pet accidents, sunscreen, and salt stains require professional-grade treatment. We pre-treat and extract stains that have penetrated below the surface. Improve Air Quality Inside Your Vehicle: Cars, RVs, and boats have limited ventilation. Dirty interior surfaces trap allergens, dust mites, mold spores, and pet dander. A professional deep clean dramatically reduces these contaminants. Protect Your Investment: Regular professional car & RV cleaning helps preserve the value and condition of your interior materials, whether it is leather, fabric, or carpet. Our Car & RV Cleaning Services in Orange County At Carpet & Duct Cleaning, we offer comprehensive interior cleaning for all vehicle types. Our car & RV cleaning services include: Car Interior Carpet Cleaning: Full extraction of dirt, stains, and odors from all floor carpets, mats, and trunk liners using professional hot-water extraction equipment. Vehicle Upholstery Cleaning: Deep cleaning of fabric seats, headliners, door panels, and armrests. We treat all types of upholstery including cloth, velvet, and synthetic fabrics. RV Interior Cleaning: Complete interior treatment for RVs, including living areas, bedrooms, bathrooms, and driving compartments. RV interiors need special attention because of the variety of surfaces and moisture buildup. Boat & Yacht Cleaning: Marine-grade interior carpet and upholstery cleaning for boats, sailboats, and yachts in Orange County marinas. Salt air and humidity create unique cleaning challenges that require professional-grade solutions. How Often Should You Schedule Car & RV Cleaning? For most vehicles used daily, we recommend professional car & RV cleaning at least once or twice a year. If you have pets, children, or use your vehicle frequently for long trips, quarterly cleaning can help maintain a fresh, odor-free environment. RV owners should schedule a thorough cleaning at the start and end of each travel season to prevent mold, mildew, and odor buildup. For boat and yacht owners, we recommend cleaning after every few weeks of heavy use or at the end of the sailing season. What to Expect From Our Car & RV Cleaning Process Our professional car & RV cleaning process is thorough, efficient, and safe for all interior surfaces. Here is what happens during a typical service visit: First, we pre-inspect all surfaces to identify stains and odor sources. Next, we pre-treat problem areas with professional spotting agents. Then we use our truck-mounted hot-water extraction system for a deep clean. Finally, we use air movers to speed up drying so your vehicle is ready as quickly as possible. Why Choose Carpet & Duct Cleaning for Your Vehicle? We are a trusted local provider of car & RV cleaning services throughout Orange County, CA. Our team uses professional truck-mounted equipment and eco-friendly cleaning solutions that are safe for your family, pets, and vehicle materials. We bring the same expertise we apply to residential carpet and duct cleaning to every vehicle interior we service. Ready to experience a cleaner, fresher vehicle interior? Contact us today to schedule your professional car & RV cleaning service in Orange County. You can also learn more about our residential carpet cleaning and duct cleaning services ."
